T*
(power over the source of your anger than you do. I did learn that lesson, but it did not come) Tj
T*
(naturally. One thing in particular that I learned is that in a company there is a shared) Tj
T*
(vision, and if you don?t agree with it and are not in a position to change it, you should not) Tj
T*
(start a mutiny, not even a small-scale one. Nothing good comes from that. In the discussion) Tj
T*
(around that topic, one of the most upvoted comments on the Lobsters thread asked a question I) Tj
T*
(had to think about quite a bit: How can you work in tech right now and not be angry? In the) Tj
T*
(context of the thread, this was clearly also about AI and agents. For me, the emotions I would) Tj
T*
(expect in tech vis-a-vis these new developments are disorientation and anxiety, but not anger.) Tj
